'''Jade Dragon''' is an [[NPC]] found in the [[Dragon's Lair (Galatea)|Dragon's Lair]] on [[Galatea]]. The entrance located at -660 56 -9. They sell the  {{Item|Jade Dragon Pet}} for {{Coins|500m}}, {{Item|Figstone|amount=64}}, {{Item|Mangcore|amount=64}}, {{Item|Helixis|amount=64}} and {{Item|Shiniest|amount=1}}. Purchasing the egg grants the [[Achievements#The Jade Dragon's Egg|The Jade Dragon's Egg]] achievement to the players.

